TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}Şöyle bir düşününce,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} ben bu kasabanın
